      "deferred_scope": "Factions have differentiated resources/actions, exact knowledge gates, relationship feedback, material autonomous effects, evidence-gated world-arc work and bounded interstate theaters. Dynamic polities negotiate alliances, nonaggression, tribute, access, guarantees, client-state arrangements, hostage compacts, consent-bound marriage alliances, reparations, negotiated territorial exchange and coalitions. Coalition conferences organize multiple exact sovereign invitations through the same travel/consent machinery; invitation never creates membership. Client-state defection, appointment-bloc evidence, exact court judgment enforcement and pre-enforcement appeals are executable. Bespoke court traditions and separate appellate institutions remain descriptive rather than parallel simulation engines."
